# Agent worktrees
# Transient checkouts of this repository that the Claude Code harness creates
# when it runs an agent in isolation. They are whole copies of the tree and are
# removed when the agent finishes; committing one would add the repository to
# itself. Anything else under .claude/ (settings, skills) stays tracked.
.claude/worktrees/
